{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/6953", "id": 529186382, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTI5MTg2Mzgy", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6953", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6953.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6953.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/6953", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/6953/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/6953/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/6953/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/statuses/8a8c85150738591382ec37919db3f84b64e4404e", "number": 6953, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "[Dubbo-6954] Reset ExtensionLoader in ExtensionLoaderTest", "user": {"login": "lzx404243", "id": 19499960, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDk5OTYw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19499960?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243", "html_url": "https://github.com/lzx404243", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What is the purpose of the change\r\nThe tests are not idempotent and fails if run twice in the same JVM, because each of the tests pollutes state shared among tests:\r\n* `dubbo-common,org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoaderTest.test_replaceExtension_Adaptive`\r\n* `dubbo-common,org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoaderTest.test_AddExtension`\r\n* `dubbo-common,org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoaderTest.test_replaceExtension`\r\n\r\nIt may be good to clean this state pollution so that some other tests do not fail in the future due to the shared state polluted by these tests.\r\n\r\n## Brief changelog\r\n\r\nCall `ExtensionLoader.resetExtensionLoader()` to reset the ExtensionLoader for the certain extension types used in each tests in `test_replaceExtension_Adaptive`, `test_AddExtension`, and `test_replaceExtension`.\r\n\r\n## Verifying this change\r\nWith the proposed fix, the test does not pollute the shared state (and passes when run twice in the same JVM).\r\n\r\nLink to issue: https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/6954", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-11-29T21:51:21Z", "updated_at": "2021-04-12T08:34:30Z", "closed_at": "2021-04-12T08:34:30Z", "merged_at": "2021-04-12T08:34:30Z", "merge_commit_sha": "0171947d6e42b1e0a5998ff8e6b1069de2e774bb", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "lzx404243:zli89-ExtensionLoaderTest-fix", "ref": "zli89-ExtensionLoaderTest-fix", "repo": {"id": 311002081, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzMTEwMDIwODE=", "name": "dubbo", "full_name": "lzx404243/dubbo", "owner": {"login": "lzx404243", "id": 19499960, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDk5OTYw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19499960?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243", "html_url": "https://github.com/lzx404243", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/us